{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Loops/N plus one half", ALGOL 68 solution loops-n-plus-one-half-2.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Loops/N_plus_one_half#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/loops-n-plus-one-half-2.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
for i to 10 do
  print(whole(i, -2));
  if i < 10 then
    print(", ")
  fi
od;

print(new_line)
)
